          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "-- VOC index from the SEN65: 100 is the usual level at this spot, above means more VOCs.\r\n-- Readings of exactly 0 are left out: the index runs from 1 to 500, so 0 isn't a real reading.\r\nSELECT ts AS time, num_value AS \"VOC index\"\r\nFROM reading_value\r\nWHERE $__timeFilter(ts)\r\n  AND station = 'mstn-2b' AND source = 'particulates'\r\n  AND section = 'values' AND key = 'voc_index'\r\n  AND ts_src <> 'estimated'\r\n  AND num_value <> 0\r\nORDER BY ts",
          "refId": "A",
          "sql": {
            "columns": [
              {
                "parameters": [],
                "type": "function"
